      <!-- RELIC PRIORITY -->
      <div class="eg-content-card" id="relics">
        <h2>Relic Priority</h2>
        <p>Relics have major breakpoints. As a F2P or low-spender, hit the <strong>minimum effective breakpoint</strong> first rather than maxing one relic completely.</p>
        <div class="eg-team-example">
          <h4>Priority Rule</h4>
          <p>Upgrade relics for heroes that help you rank higher in <strong>Torment Rift</strong> and clear <strong>Odyssey</strong>. Better ranks = better rewards = faster account growth.</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Suggested Early Targets</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Isis:</strong> aim for Relic Level 20 early.</li>
          <li><strong>Poseidon:</strong> strong impact at Relic Level 10.</li>
          <li><strong>Tefnut:</strong> fully usable around Relic Level 20.</li>
          <li><strong>High-end celestial units:</strong> often scale best at Relic Level 30 - save these for later.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Priority Order</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>PvE core carries first:</strong> your main damage dealers (e.g. Isis to Relic 20).</li>
          <li><strong>Key timing relics second:</strong> heroes whose relic changes the opening seconds (e.g. Poseidon at Relic 10).</li>
          <li><strong>Premium endgame investments last:</strong> level 30+ is expensive - only when income supports it.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <!-- ZODIAC -->
      <div class="eg-content-card" id="zodiac">
        <h2>Which Zodiac Should You Pick?</h2>
        <p>The best Zodiac depends on your <strong>Bond bonuses</strong>. Check which bonds you can maximize before switching.</p>
        <div class="eg-warning-box">
          <h3>Switching Costs Gems</h3>
          <p>Switching Zodiac costs around <strong>999 gems</strong> each time. Pick one you can commit to early unless you have a clear plan.</p>
        </div>
        <h3>Recommended Picks</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Gemini (default):</strong> AoE leap with stun - great for stage clearing and PvP.</li>
          <li><strong>Pisces (control):</strong> vortex / pull control with stuns at higher relic levels.</li>
          <li><strong>Capricorn (tactical):</strong> swap / pull utility for difficult stages.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Why the Zodiac hero is special</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>You can switch between forms depending on what you need.</li>
          <li>Relic level is inherited when you switch forms - uniquely efficient investment.</li>
          <li>Activating Bond gifts for multiple forms grants additional stats.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- TOTEMS -->
