        <h2>Totems and Suit Advantage</h2>
        <h3>Suit Advantage - Always Check It</h3>
        <p>In bosses and PvE fights, suit advantage is a direct damage multiplier. If the boss is <strong>Spades</strong>, use <strong>Hearts</strong> to deal more damage.</p>
        <h3>Which Totem to Use</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Keystone of Wonders:</strong> only when your team has many different suits.</li>
          <li><strong>Horn of Potency:</strong> the safe early default when you have 1 to 2 suits - simple and consistent team-wide ATK boost.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

