          <li><strong>Place gods strategically</strong> - some are filler for global buffs (speed, crit), others boost your main faction.</li>
          <li><strong>Seats matter:</strong> each seat provides unique bonuses. Match gods to seats that amplify their strengths.</li>
          <li><strong>Artefacts</strong> give additional stat boosts to placed gods. Upgrade them when resources allow.</li>
          <li><strong>Talismans</strong> provide powerful passive effects. Prioritize ones that benefit your core team.</li>
